colorectal liver metastases: a prospective study</article-title><source><italic>Annals of Surgical Oncology</italic></source><year>2002</year><volume>9</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>430</fpage><lpage>438</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12052752</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tocchi</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Mazzoni</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Brozzetti</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Miccini</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Cassini</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Bettelli</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Hepatic resection in stage IV colorectal cancer: prognostic predictors of outcome</article-title><source><italic>International Journal of Colorectal Disease</italic></source><year>2004</year><volume>19</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>580</fpage><lpage>585</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15103491</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kokudo</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Seki</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ohta</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Effects of systemic and regional chemotherapy after hepatic resection for colorectal metastases</article-title><source><italic>Annals of Surgical Oncology</italic></source><year>1998</year><volume>5</volume><issue>8</issue><fpage>706</fpage><lpage>712</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9869517</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kemeny</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Jarnagin</surname><gi